Page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/where-your-eyes-don-t-go">Where Your Eyes Don't Go</a> (where-your-eyes-don-t-go)<br/>Current revision number: 24<br/>Date changed: Sat, 19 Dec 2020 10:11:12 +0000<br/>Change type: source change<br/>Change comments: Some typos and missing point.<br/>By: <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greyzor" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6932693); return false;" >Greyzor</a></span><br/><br/>Page content preview: <br/>&quot;Grandma!&quot;
Shirley looked down over her newspaper. Ralph was standing there, with a fistful of wooden blocks, beaming up at her. &quot;Can we play Director, grandma?&quot;
She smiled...
